 (r.verification_status='VERIFIED' AND r.description='D02: 12 branches x first/middle/last part, 36 source passages PDF25-28; 40-minute convention is a separate project decision.' AND r.reviewer='Codex D02 review 2026-10-25 (same-tool second pass)'
 AND r.reviewed_at IS NOT NULL AND r.verification_note='D02 2026-10-25; two visual passes by the same Codex, not independent human review. Normalized spacing/punctuation; original archaic words retained. Scope=source table and selected transcription, not empirical validity. docs/29-D02-TAM-THE-DATA.md. 36 literal passages PDF25-28 verified; unusual ages 12/44 and Khac cua preserved. Source says three parts, not 40 minutes. Equal 40-minute segmentation and corrected So4->So5 reference are TEAM_DECISION DEC-20261025-D02-HOUR-PARTS; source transcription approval is scoped separately.'
 AND s.source_book_id=(SELECT id FROM source_books WHERE title='Diễn Cầm Tam Thế Diễn Nghĩa' AND edition='Bản PDF scan người dùng cung cấp; chưa xác minh ấn bản in') AND s.section_label='TT-36-PHAN' AND s.pdf_page=25 AND s.printed_page_label='26')))<>1
