 (r.verification_status='VERIFIED' AND r.description='D02: seasonal hour anchors for all 12 lunar months, PDF12-15; original labels retained with documented project corrections.' AND r.reviewer='Codex D02 review 2026-10-25 (same-tool second pass)'
